# Push new build (QR-East_Industrial_Database)

When the user asks to push, deploy, publish, or go live:

## Remember

- **Live site** is **Cloudflare Pages** (quadreal): https://qr-east-industrial-database.pages.dev/
- **GitHub** is for **version tracking** only. Pushing to `main` runs CI — it does **not** host the app.
- Prefer **`push-cloudflare-build`** (phrase: **push a new build to Cloudflare quadreal**) — that skill commits, pushes to GitHub, then deploys Cloudflare.
- **Map data** lives in Supabase — edits while signed in take effect immediately (no JSON sync step).
- **Never commit** `.env.local` or files containing secrets.
- **Version policy:** local app changes already bump the version while coding (`npm run version:bump:if-needed`). Before commit, run `version:bump:if-needed` once more. Update `CHANGELOG.md` when the version differs from the last commit.

## Going live (preferred)

Follow `.cursor/skills/push-cloudflare-build/SKILL.md` Path A (quadreal):

1. Summarize chat work for changelog
2. `npm run version:bump:if-needed`
3. Changelog if version moved
4. `npm run sync:qr360-viewer`
5. typecheck / lint / test
6. Commit + push to `main`
7. `npm run deploy` (Cloudflare Pages)
8. Mirror to `QR-East_Industrial_Database-Cloudflare` so that folder stays aligned

## GitHub-only (history, no live deploy)

Use `@release-and-push` or `npm run push-live` when they only want commits on GitHub without updating Cloudflare.

## After a Cloudflare ship

- Live: https://qr-east-industrial-database.pages.dev/
- Version label from `BUILD_VERSION_LABEL`
- Hard-refresh when deploy finishes
- CI on the GitHub push: https://github.com/quadreal-r/QR-East_Industrial_Database/actions

## R2 media (when picture/document binaries changed)

```powershell
npm run upload-rtu-pictures-r2 -- --from-folder "C:/path/to/pictures"
npm run upload-rtu-documents-r2 -- --from-folder "C:/path/to/docs" --skip-existing
```

Picture/document **metadata** is in Supabase — update via the app while signed in, or run `npm run migrate-json-to-supabase` for bulk legacy import.

## User shortcut phrases

| Phrase | Do this |
|--------|---------|
| **"push a new build to Cloudflare quadreal"** | Full `push-cloudflare-build` Path A |
| **"Everything is good now, push the code"** | Prefer full Cloudflare ship (commit + push + deploy), not GitHub-only |

